' === CAMPAIGN TYPES ===
note as CampaignTypes
**MARKETING CAMPAIGN TYPES:**

1. Birthday Campaign
2. New Customer Campaign
3. Loyal Customer Campaign
4. Weekend Sale
5. Flash Sale
6. Seasonal Campaign
7. Free Shipping
8. Cashback
9. Cart Abandonment Recovery
10. Review Reward
11. Manual Campaign
end note

' === CAMPAIGN RULES ===
note as CampaignRules
**CAMPAIGN RULES:**

• Minimum Order Amount
• Customer Total Orders
• Customer Total Spent
• Province/City
• Payment Method
• Category/Product
• Day of Week
• First Order Only
• Registered Date Range
end note

' === NOTES ===
note bottom of UC62
**Import Excel:**
• Download template per product type
• Validation rules per category
• Bulk insert with progress
• Error reporting & fix
• Max 1000 rows per import
end note

note bottom of UC66
**Staff Management:**
• CRUD staff accounts
• Assign roles (Admin/Staf)
• Set permissions
• View staff activity log
• Reset staff password
end note

note bottom of UC70
**Farmer Verification:**
• Check farm documents (license, photos)
• Verify farm location
• Check product quality
• Verify owner identity
• Approve or reject with reason
end note

note bottom of UC68
**Campaign Management:**
• Create campaign with rules
• Set budget & usage limits
• Auto-generate vouchers
• Schedule start/end date
• Track campaign performance
end note

note bottom of UC71
**Financial Reports:**
• Daily/Weekly/Monthly/Yearly
• Revenue breakdown by category
• Order statistics
• Profit margin analysis
• Tax reports
end note

note bottom of UC75
**Delivery Areas:**
• Province/City coverage
• Fee per area
• Estimated delivery days
• Active/inactive status
• Special handling requirements
end note

